							Cleric-DPS&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br />Druid-Swiss army knife<br />Enchanter-mana, mez / maybe bard<br />Paladin-meatshield, heals<br />Monk-dps, pulls<br />Mage-nukes, pet dps, mods, ds<br /><br />Overall, this would cover most all basis imo
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
