								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=805.msg8208#msg8208">Re: Perfect Group</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #19 on:</b> June 03, 2004, 08:30:15 am &#187;</span></td>
