								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							clr/enc/shm/sk/rog/rog<br /><br />i don&#039;t like warriors at all over hybrids unless its absolutely neccessary, which it may or may not be. i&#039;ll still take darkness over paladin heals, even though fd is pretty trivial these days.
