								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=805.msg8217#msg8217">Re: Perfect Group</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #21 on:</b> June 03, 2004, 04:12:08 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Don&#039;t think i have a perfect&nbsp; group but im a big fan of bards skilled ones that is. They can pull just about anything, mez most mobs, overhaste, nuke focus spell, mana song, and with good gear can also put in some decent meeelee dps.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
