							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Guild Leader of Chaotic Discord {World of Warcraft}<br /><a href="http://www.wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?name=Kinladar&amp;s_id=38" target="_blank">http://www.wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?name=Kinladar&amp;s_id=38</a><br /><br />Guild Leader of Fires of Time (Retired)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
