								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hey LTNS guys&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /> My perfect group Nytankee (Warrior)&nbsp; Kinladar (Ranger) Jovious (Wizard) Dlove (Cleric) Nosterafu (Necro) and Kanashya (Beastlord) Nytankee and Itstak are semi-retired but still active. Me, Jovious and Kattank and soon Zippy and Dlove are all playing EQ2 on the Blackburrow server so if any come over to the new and improved EQ definately create a charachter on Blackburrow Server. Long live Rodcet Nife and friends!!<br /><br />Itstak Buffalot (Go pull Otto Kinladar!)<br />Nytankee Sowpleeze (Damn Ranger, Taunt!)
						</td>
