								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The Best perma group I was in <br /><br />Karadana(Shm)<br />Mamael(Clr)<br />Mazzar(Enc)<br />Kaiyne(Pal)<br />Ssnakess(Mnk)<br />Me(Rogue)<br /><br />When all that ended I would have to say when it was.... <br /><br />.Me<br />Fysts/Erfin<br />(Any tank really)Meraudir alot, but there were better choices gear-wise.<br />Doctress<br />Corboy<br /><br />....We would beat the fuck out of anything<br /><br />
						</td>
